sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Reference App
    participant SCC as scc_encoder
    participant SEIBuilder as SEI Payload Builder
    participant FF as libavformat / libavcodec
    participant File as .mp4 / RTP Stream

    App->>SCC: encode_frame(rgb, depth)
    SCC->>SEIBuilder: pack(uuid + version + payload)
    Note right of SEIBuilder: Payload type 5 =<br/>user_data_unregistered<br/>(ISO/IEC 14496-10 §D.1.6)
    SEIBuilder-->>SCC: byte buffer (NAL-escaped)
    SCC-->>App: SEI bytes + RGB
    App->>FF: send RGB packet (encode)
    App->>FF: side_data(AV_PKT_DATA_NEW_EXTRADATA / SEI inject)
    FF->>FF: emit NAL units in order:<br/>[SPS] [PPS] [SEI:scc] [IDR-slice]
    FF->>File: write mux-frame
    Note over File: SCC payload now travels<br/>inside the H.264 elementary<br/>stream — no out-of-band channel.
